   "List A courses must come from at least two of five areas: Area 1 History or Government (ETHS 130 F through POSC 250 F), Area 2 Arts and Humanities (PHIL 135 F, PHIL 195 F), Area 3 Social Science (PSY 131 F, SOC 102 F, SOC 277 F), Area 4 Quantitative Reasoning and Research Methods (STAT C1000 group, PSY 202 F group), Area 5 Major Preparation (ETHS 129 F through SOC 101 F). The area constraint is not encoded in the block.",
